1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,012
Storybook Woods: fairies, flowers and a winding river.

2
00:00:03,012 --> 00:00:05,121
But blood flows in the woods all the same.

3
00:00:05,341 --> 00:00:07,091
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,543
There's no special setup here.

5
00:00:09,763 --> 00:00:12,559
But the woods have fewer spaces than most locations.

6
00:00:12,559 --> 00:00:16,914
That makes it look easy, but with everything so close together, it gets dangerous

7
00:00:16,914 --> 00:00:17,613
very quickly.

8
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:21,423
Three rickety bridges cross the River, circled in red here.

9
00:00:21,423 --> 00:00:25,679
They could collapse under too much weight, so only one Victim will follow you across

10
00:00:25,679 --> 00:00:26,135
a bridge.

11
00:00:26,355 --> 00:00:30,356
The Troll Bridge event can add a fourth bridge token, with the same one-Victim

12
00:00:30,356 --> 00:00:30,664
limit.

13
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,891
If you find the Raft, place its four tokens on the marked Raft spaces, each touching

14
00:00:35,891 --> 00:00:37,303
both the River and a space.

15
00:00:37,523 --> 00:00:41,778
When you're in one of those spaces, you can use one movement to travel to any other

16
00:00:41,778 --> 00:00:45,674
space with a Raft token. But you pay one Time for every Raft token you pass,

17
00:00:45,674 --> 00:00:47,827
counting the ones you start and finish at.

18
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:50,727
A few cards change how you move and fight.

19
00:00:50,727 --> 00:00:54,564
The Red Cape makes the Killer target you instead of a Victim when it's a tie.

20
00:00:54,784 --> 00:00:59,046
The Songbirds cost three Time to hit a Killer within two spaces for three damage.

21
00:00:59,046 --> 00:01:03,360
The Breadcrumb Path event links two spaces as a shortcut, but only you can use it.

22
00:01:04,167 --> 00:01:08,258
Watch for The Full Moon is Out: roll to place the Killer in the Clearing, Meadow or

23
00:01:08,258 --> 00:01:09,884
Glen, killing every Victim there.

24
00:01:10,104 --> 00:01:13,983
Two Terror cards have the Killer carry a Victim off towards Grandmother's House.

25
00:01:13,983 --> 00:01:17,037
And the Pied Piper event kills any Victim who ends up with him.

26
00:01:17,867 --> 00:01:21,082
A few tips. The board is small, so the Killer is never far away:

27
00:01:21,082 --> 00:01:21,685
keep moving.

28
00:01:21,905 --> 00:01:25,252
Crossing a bridge takes one Victim at a time, so plan your trips.

29
00:01:25,252 --> 00:01:25,767
Good luck.

